        "procedure": "L-HL (1.0 mmol), NaClO (1.0 mmol) and Y(ClO4)3 (1.0 M, 4.0 mL) were dissolved in 10 mL ethanol in the presence of triethanolamine (TEOA, 0.4 mL). The mixture was heated and stirred at 80 °C for 2 h, then filtered hot. The filtrate was left to evaporate in air. After about 2 weeks, colorless block crystals were obtained.",
